===Etymology===
{{bor+|en|sw|jenga|-jenga|to construct, to build}}.<ref>Arthur Cornwallis Madan, ''Swahili-English Dictionary'' (1903)</ref>

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|games}} A [[game]] where [[player]]s [[take turns]] [[remove|removing]] [[wooden]] [[block]]s from a [[stack]] formed [[brickwise]], the [[loser]] being the [[player]] whose [[action]]s [[cause]] the [[tower]] to [[collapse]].
# {{lb|en|figurative}} Any activity that involves great [[precision]] with a risk of great failure.

